### Body (aligned with `det-screenshot-status.check.js`)

- **Purpose** — Repo-wide metrics rule: `screenshot_status` in `visual-registry.generated.json` must match `docs/design/catalog/screenshots/{HASH}.png`, with documentation for deferred rows. PDCA workflow included.
- **Passing / failing signals** — `captured-missing-png`, `captured-missing-url`, `undocumented-status`, `unknown-status`; 12-finding cap; independence from `DET.HASH.MARKERS` / `DET.CONTRACT.PATH`.
- **Before / after HTML** — **Hbk** handbook layout from `showcase/preview-handbook.html` with real KS classes: `container-fluid`, `forge-sidebar`, `nav-scroll`, `nav-rail`, `nav-link`, `forge-brand`, `section-label`, `font-display`, `forge-card`, `card-label`, `forge-support`, `ks-site-footer-region`, plus **Ksr** / **Ksf** chrome hashes.
- **Evidence and remediation** — `screenshotStatusReport`, capture via `capture-showcase-screenshots.mjs`, `check-visual-catalog.mjs`, harness `invoke-det-ruleset-harness.sh --only-rule DET.SCREENSHOT.STATUS`.
- **Related rules** — Six linked catalog/hash/contract rules.

No Mermaid, no Fleet-specific content. Check modules and registry were not edited.
